{"resourceIdentifier":"4511","resourceName":"Silvador Climate Action","description":"Silvador Company SRL / Forest Capital SRL own private forestlands in Romania and are developing a forest carbon credit project to achieve greenhouse gas (GHG) emission reductions and removals through the deferral of harvesting on privately owned forests. The project will be implemented following the VCS VM0012 – Improved Forest Management in Temperate and Boreal Forests (LtPF), v1.2 methodology. The Group Project currently consists of a single Project Activity Instance (PAI).  The current geographic area is composed of 11 private forest parcels located in the counties of, Buzău, Dâmbovița, with future instances to be located in Arges, Prahova, and Teleorman. The PAI areas are non-contiguous area. All properties were managed for timber harvest prior to the implementation of the carbon crediting project and forest operations occurred under existing forest management plans.","location":{"latitude":44.912063,"longitude":25.450830},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-08-18","endExclusive":"2023-09-18","endInclusive":"2023-09-17"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4511"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Dambovita"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4511"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4511"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"11096"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":6824}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NA